@verbs quit save clear cls leaving
@tier player
@title saving, clearing the screen and leaving

  save

Saves your character as it is now. There is no need to keep doing
it: the game saves by itself, and again when you leave.

  quit

Ends the session. Everything is saved before you go.

  clear

Clears the screen and puts the cursor at the top. It needs a
terminal that understands that. 'cls' is the same.
